# Analysis > Trajectories and Transport > Trajectory Playback: a 61-frame
# copper MD run read on demand, frame stepping, per-frame structure-type
# colouring, unwrapped trajectory lines and GIF export of the view.
trajectory open docs/manual/examples/cu_md.extxyz
expect-tabs 1
expect-frames 61
expect-atoms 32
trajectory frame 61
expect-atoms 32
trajectory analyse on
trajectory frame 30
expect-property 1 32
trajectory lines on
trajectory gif rust/target/ui/trajectory.gif
expect-status Saved 61 frames
screenshot rust/target/ui/trajectory.png
quit
